'''Mobius''' (メビウス, ''Mebiusu'') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Crash Fever Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Mobius
|image = E 319.png
|appearance = [[Crash Fever Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 3,000¢ - 11,850¢
}}

==Enemy==
Mobius is the third and last enemy introduced in this event. She outranges most cats with an Area Attack and does considerable damage even below 100% strength magnification. Her weaknesses are a slow attack rate and animation. She is often backed up by either tough enemies or annoying foes like [[Belial (Enemy)|Belial]] and [[Otta-smack-u]]s.

